I've run the ownership tool on both paths, and I have enough to answer. One caveat first: the tool treats one of Marco Silva's two addresses as a placeholder, so I've been careful about naming Marco as a contact.

**`lib/grape_entity/exposure/`** (609 non-blank lines, 732 counting blank lines; includes `delegator_exposure.rb`)

| Author | Non-blank lines (share) | Counting blank lines (share) | Last commit here | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Vladimir Kochnev | 331 (54.4%) | 400 (54.6%) | 2015-09-18 | inactive |
| Marco Silva | 117 (19.2%) | 143 (19.5%) | 2026-08-03 | active |
| Alexander Yunin | 55 (9.0%) | 61 (8.3%) | 2016-07-04 | inactive |
| James McCarthy | 48 (7.9%) | 58 (7.9%) | 2017-04-05 | inactive |

- **Best reviewer:** Vladimir Kochnev is the top owner. They own `base.rb` (117 lines, 61.5%), `nesting_exposure.rb` (111 lines, 77.5%), `nested_exposures.rb` (74 lines, 66.2%) and `represent_exposure.rb` (42 lines, 92.9%). They have not committed since 2015-09-18, so they are probably not reachable. Alexander Yunin (second by lines among the inactive owners) owns `nesting_exposure/output_builder.rb` (59 lines, 86.4%) and is also inactive.
- **Active contact:** Marco Silva is the active owner. They hold `grouped_exposure.rb` outright (117 lines, 100%). The tool flags the address `<email redacted>` as a placeholder identity, so those 117 lines (19.2%) can't be firmly tied to a person. Treat Marco as a lead, not a confirmed owner. The only other active author is Anna Kowalczyk, with 4 lines (0.7%).
- **Concentration:** The bus factor is 1 by lines: Vladimir Kochnev alone holds 54.4% (54.6% counting blank lines). Reaching 80% takes 3 authors.
- **Orphaned code:** 9 files, 80.8% of the lines, have an inactive top owner and no active author holding 20% or more.
- **Files only one person wrote:** `grouped_exposure.rb`, `represent_exposure.rb`, `formatter_exposure.rb`, `block_exposure.rb` and `formatter_block_exposure.rb`.

**Delegator code**

This is `lib/grape_entity/delegator.rb` plus `lib/grape_entity/delegators/` (4 files). The tool took them as two separate paths, so I didn't merge them.

- **`delegators/`** (61 non-blank lines, 69 counting blank lines):
  - Vladimir Kochnev holds 47 (77.0%; 50 counting blank lines, 72.5%).
  - Paul Padier holds 5 (8.2%), James McCarthy 4 (6.6%), Dmitriy Nesteryuk 3 (4.9%).
