  - **Reviewer:** Vladimir Kochnev is the top owner. Marco Silva is the only active contact.
- **`delegator_exposure.rb`:** I haven't run a separate check on it. It sits inside the `exposure/` directory above.

**Who has effectively left (no commit in the last 365 days, as of 2026-10-05)**

- In `exposure/`, that is Vladimir Kochnev, Alexander Yunin, James McCarthy and one more author. Together they leave 80.1% of the lines with people who haven't committed in the last year. Only 2 of 18 authors there have been active.
- In `delegators/`, all 5 authors are inactive.
