**Does the most commits mean the most code?**

No. The whole-repository figures:

| Author | Non-blank lines (share) | Counting blank lines (share) | Commits (share) |
|---|---|---|---|
| Vladimir Kochnev | 1,010 (18.7%) | 1,180 (17.6%) | 11 (3.8%) |
